{"4678250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DRAWN TO RACE", "steam_appid": 4678250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAWN TO RACE</strong> is a high-octane arcade racer where the adrenaline of the track meets the strategic depth of the <strong>roguelike genre.</strong> Drive through a world with hand drawing style sketch aesthetics, overtake opponents, drift and speed through corners to progress through the tracks. <br><br><strong>The Ultimate Roguelike Racing Loop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every race is a battle for survival and growth. Drift, overtake or speed through the circuit to gain experience. Every level-up presents a critical choice: which upgrade card will you add to your build? No two runs are the same, and one wrong turn could end your circuit forever.<br><br><strong>Choose Your Build and Strategize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to be a <strong>speed demon?</strong> Cut through corners, find the <strong>apex line</strong> and speed through the laps? Upgrade your car accordingly: <strong>Handling</strong>, <strong>Acceleration</strong> or <strong>Top speed Upgrade Cards</strong>! Lap time is important for you to gain experience and some opponents are much faster than expected, can you keep up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/bef181ceac7137af6c7c202626636f14.poster.avif?t=1787697375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/bef181ceac7137af6c7c202626636f14.webm?t=1787697375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/bef181ceac7137af6c7c202626636f14.mp4?t=1787697375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Are you a <strong>smooth operator</strong> and here to <strong>flow like water?</strong> Does <strong>drifting </strong>inches from the wall satisfy you the most? Upgrade your car with <strong>Drifting Speed, Angle</strong> or even <strong>Exit Speed Upgrade Cards</strong>! Don't forget that drifting also gives experience, more levels equals more upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/e42e9d90b91288edb0b7f4b18b191e7e.poster.avif?t=1787697375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/e42e9d90b91288edb0b7f4b18b191e7e.webm?t=1787697375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/e42e9d90b91288edb0b7f4b18b191e7e.mp4?t=1787697375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Against Bosses, Unlock Cars</strong><br>You are not the only racer in this sketchy world. There are many serious opponents for you to defeat. Each poses a different type of challenge for you to overcome. Level up through the circuit and get ready for a difficult face-off with one of the bosses. Defeat them in a race to earn various rewards, unlock new cars and progress through the tracks! Some cars that you unlock might be a better fit for the build that you want to create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/5c5098cd873c83de12baca2357297dd8.poster.avif?t=1787697375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/5c5098cd873c83de12baca2357297dd8.webm?t=1787697375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/5c5098cd873c83de12baca2357297dd8.mp4?t=1787697375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you excited for a completely new experience in roguelike scene? We are excited to be with you on this ink-stained arcade racing journey! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist DRAWN TO RACE now to stay updated on a brand new roguelike racing experience!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/a2220c87f83cc3b41e337afc09ed0183.poster.avif?t=1787697375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/a2220c87f83cc3b41e337afc09ed0183.webm?t=1787697375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/a2220c87f83cc3b41e337afc09ed0183.mp4?t=1787697375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAWN TO RACE</strong> is a high-octane arcade racer where the adrenaline of the track meets the strategic depth of the <strong>roguelike genre.</strong> Drive through a world with hand drawing style sketch aesthetics, overtake opponents, drift and speed through corners to progress through the tracks. <br><br><strong>The Ultimate Roguelike Racing Loop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every race is a battle for survival and growth. Drift, overtake or speed through the circuit to gain experience. Every level-up presents a critical choice: which upgrade card will you add to your build? No two runs are the same, and one wrong turn could end your circuit forever.<br><br><strong>Choose Your Build and Strategize</strong></p><p 