4678250/extras/e42e9d90b91288edb0b7f4b18b191e7e.mp4?t=1787697375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Against Bosses, Unlock Cars</strong><br>You are not the only racer in this sketchy world. There are many serious opponents for you to defeat. Each poses a different type of challenge for you to overcome. Level up through the circuit and get ready for a difficult face-off with one of the bosses. Defeat them in a race to earn various rewards, unlock new cars and progress through the tracks! Some cars that you unlock might be a better fit for the build that you want to create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/5c5098cd873c83de12baca2357297dd8.poster.avif?t=1787697375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/5c5098cd873c83de12baca2357297dd8.webm?t=1787697375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/5c5098cd873c83de12baca2357297dd8.mp4?t=1787697375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you excited for a completely new experience in roguelike scene? We are excited to be with you on this ink-stained arcade racing journey! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist DRAWN TO RACE now to stay updated on a brand new roguelike racing experience!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/a2220c87f83cc3b41e337afc09ed0183.poster.avif?t=1787697375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678250/extras/a